# Every dotfile, at any depth, is ignored unless named below (hygiene XII
# item 4, from the walk of the daily driver: a token or key dropped beside the
# tree must never be staged). That covers the shell's exports (.envrc), every
# dot-named credential file, .terraform/, the plugin cache and editor residue
# without naming them.
.*
!.gitignore
!.github
!.githooks
!.csis-version
!**/.terraform.lock.hcl
# the TEST identity the starter ships, committed on purpose (README); delete
# these two lines with it
!.age-identity
!.age-recipient
# Credential files that are not dotfiles: never committed
*.pem
# The private mirror: the plaintext an execution runs from
_private
# Tool residue and the run-local files; generated/ itself IS committed (a
# --commit run stages meta-state/ and generated/)
**/target/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
tfplan
*.tfvars
!generated/bootstrap/bootstrap.auto.tfvars
YAML_DUMP.yaml
__pycache__/
